{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服！\n私はリボンです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ayane.suzuki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/ayane.suzuki/img/2015/06/15/6916246/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表題のタイトルは太陽ノック。\nアンダー楽曲も素敵な曲です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月7日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ayane.suzuki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/ayane.suzuki/img/2015/06/15/6916246/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月14日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ayane.suzuki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/ayane.suzuki/img/2015/06/15/6916246/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11thの握手会では\n今までよりたくさんの方が\n私のところへ足を運んでくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんとお話して\n目標を再確認したり\n私にとって有意義な時間となりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方とお話しができて\n楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方も\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非また遊びに来て下さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の握手会は7月26日です。\nよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ayane.suzuki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/ayane.suzuki/img/2015/06/15/6916246/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問が多かった\n\"本について\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなジャンルは\nSF小説 現代小説 時代小説。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番好きな本は\n筒井康隆さんの時をかける少女。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段あまり読書しない方に\n短編で読みやすいこの本を\nオススメすることが多いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近読んだ本は星の王子さま。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの翻訳本。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃\nこの小説の意味が\n理解できませんでしたが\n今読み返すと考える事、悩む事の\n大切さを知る事ができます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非\n皆さんのオススメの本も\n教えて下さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鈴木絢音"}],"source":"archive"}